     <td><para unique="1261851">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261853">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261855">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1261859">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+549644"/> </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261864">Convert two packed single precision floating-point values in xmm2/m64/m32bcst to packed double precision floating-point values in xmm1 with writemask k1.</para>
